5,1,1,talk,Servas,,Let us ensure our foundation is steady. I am interested in how new holdings affect our reporting cycles and the clarity of their figures.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I want to verify the actual drivers of our past successes. We need to know if the growth was sustainable or just a narrative.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,I believe we must prioritize our long-term capital stability. I want to understand our future obligations and our current borrowing capacity.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,I'm so excited for this! But we really need to check if we can actually find the people these companies need without burning ourselves out!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I am concerned about the gap between funding and deployment. I want to see where the actual bottlenecks occur before the first customer goes live.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Mio, your energy is wonderful. However, we must balance that enthusiasm with a rigorous look at our internal administrative burdens.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Asuka,,Agreed. I will be looking specifically at customer retention and the reality of our previous exits to avoid repeating mistakes.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minako,,I agree with the need for rigor. We cannot afford to overlook the financial pressure on the fund itself as we scale.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mio,,"I know, I know! That's why I want to see who is actually available to help us and how fast we can hire!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I will focus on the technical and regulatory hurdles that typically cause delays in the initial deployment phase.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,Wisdom comes from transparency. I shall look into the independent checks and the appraisal needs to see if we can simplify our quarter-end.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will focus on account retention through price rises and the profile of the exits and the write-off.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minako,,"I will investigate the reserve accounts and follow-on calls, as well as the terms of last winter's credit line.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mio,,I'm going for the recruiter placement times and the adviser bench! I want to know who is actually free to work!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will examine the security review time before first deployment and the delivery records of two holdings.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
